OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hope for new leads in 2001
OL,4,Aattack as woman reveals how life
OL,5,Achanged
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Clare Carmichael was 36, she was
OL,8,Fsavagely beaten and left for dead in an
OL,9,Fattempted murder that remains unsolved
OL,10,F25 years later.
OL,12,FThe attack at her former home in
OL,13,FKinton, near Leintwardine, in
OL,14,FHerefordshire, on the morning of 28
OL,15,FSeptember 2001, left her with severe
OL,16,Fhead injuries, requiring six months in
OL,17,Fhospital and continuing to affect her
OL,18,Fdaily life years later.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
