OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hope for new leads in 2001
OL,4,Aattack as woman reveals how life
OL,5,Achanged
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a fresh appeal issued through West
OL,8,FMercia Police, Carmichael urged anyone
OL,9,Fwith information about the person
OL,10,Fresponsible to come forward.
OL,12,F"So much changed for me on that day,
OL,13,Fthe life I wanted to live was taken
OL,14,Faway from me," she said.
